      "text": "ISOLATION GATE (#2) \u2014 the FIRST thing DeployForTeam does, before any DB or Docker call\nper-team isolation enforced?   yes \u2192 proceed    \u00b7    no / not yet verified \u2192 REFUSE (503, fail closed)\noverride: OSCTF_ALLOW_UNISOLATED_INSTANCES (local trial only) \u2192 proceed, but log loudly",
